      "link": "https://www.mdpi.com/2227-7390/12/14/2189/html",
      "contributions": [
        "The supplied search summary describes a GRU-derived gate for selecting informative subsequences.",
        "Motivates adaptive selection of historical context."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Its architecture differs from NextItNet.",
        "Transfer to positionwise gated dilated residual blocks requires evaluation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sampled-softmax research by Wu et al.",
      "link": "https://wujcan.github.io/papers/tois-ssm.pdf",
      "contributions": [
        "The supplied search summary describes implicit emphasis on hard negatives through sampled softmax.",
        "Highlights temperature as a control on difficult-negative gradient concentration."
      ],
      "limitations": [
        "Stronger sampled separation does not establish improved host validation HR@10.",
        "Excessive emphasis on difficult negatives can concentrate gradients and include latent positives."
      ]
    },
    {
